    {
      "finding": "Python3.9的monotonic时基不适合作为跨进程显示链接/xctrace时间戳。",
      "python": "3.9.6 (default, Oct 19 2026, 19:18:13) \n[Clang 21.0.0 (clang-2100.4.1.1)]",
      "processClockSamples": [
        {
          "pid": 15127,
