          "machHostSeconds": 159153.36199025
        },
        {
          "pid": 15132,
          "monotonicSeconds": 0.1380165,
          "machHostSeconds": 159154.53439308333
        }
      ],
      "previousSmokePhase": {
        "start": 0.192727708,
        "end": 1.712513333
      },
      "fix": "phase.json改为mach_absolute_time乘mach_timebase_info再换算秒；响应等待预算继续使用monotonic。"
    },
    {
      "finding": "原失败trace无法导出。",
      "trace": "/Users/yuwk/WorkSpace/Code/Github/MacView/.worktree/s2-p0/build/acceptance/scroll-cold-record/record.trace",
      "exportExitCode": 10,
      "exportError": "Trace is malformed; instrument run data is missing",
      "cleanupGap": "失败trap原先发SIGINT后不等待xctrace保存；本轮补wait。该缺口与损坏现象一致，未证明它是state超时根因。"
    },
    {
      "finding": "FileSettingsStore是final class而非actor；global()是nonisolated async，内部读取JSONDocumentStore的Mutex值。",
      "conclusion": "async调用存在协作线程池往返；本轮没有复现其导致超时，不把它认定为根因，不修改state调度或快照架构。"
    },
    {
      "finding": "每次flip前重复view.paged会进入ReaderSession.update，即使值相同也做layoutFrames、remember、prefetch。",
      "fix": "内存场景按实际browseMode条件切换，保留动作与预算。"
    }
  ],
